<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Babel Goods</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/style.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/details.css" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/images/lg.png" type="image/x-icon" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <section class="project-detail">
      <div class="container">
        <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to Home</a>
        <h1>Babel Goods – E-commerce Platform</h1>

        <img src="/images/P1.png" alt="Babel Goods" class="project-banner" />

        <p class="description">
          <strong>Babel Goods</strong> is a modern e-commerce platform that
          allows users to browse a wide variety of products, add items to a
          dynamic cart, and place orders easily through an intuitive interface.
        </p>

        <h2>Main Features:</h2>
        <ul class="features">
          <li>🛒 Dynamic product catalog</li>
          <li>📦 Fast and simple order form</li>
          <li>📊 Complete order management</li>
          <li>🎯 Responsive and fluid design</li>
          <li>🔍 Real-time product filtering</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Technologies Used:</h2>
        <ul class="tech-stack">
          <li>⚛️ React</li>
          <li>💨 Tailwind CSS</li>
          <li>⚡ Vite.js</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Challenges Faced:</h2>
        <ul class="challenges">
          <li>
            🔄 Implementing a dynamic cart without page reload required careful
            state management using React.
          </li>
          <li>
            🧩 Achieving full responsiveness across all devices demanded several
            CSS adjustments.
          </li>
          <li>
            ⏱️ Optimizing performance while loading large product lists was key
            for smooth UX.
          </li>
          <li>
            🔐 Ensuring data security and order validation without a full
            backend posed an architectural challenge.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Solutions Implemented:</h2>
        <ul class="solutions">
          <li>
            ✅ Used <strong>useState</strong> and
            <strong>useEffect</strong> hooks to handle cart logic efficiently.
          </li>
          <li>
            ✅ Built reusable components to reduce code duplication and improve
            maintainability.
          </li>
          <li>
            ✅ Applied lazy loading for images and non-critical modules to boost
            performance.
          </li>
          <li>
            ✅ Integrated simple form validation and alerts to prevent order
            errors.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Conclusion:</h2>
        <p>
          This project helped strengthen my skills in modern frontend
          development. It demonstrates my ability to design a full-featured,
          user-oriented application. Babel Goods is more than just a technical
          showcase—it's built to provide a smooth and engaging shopping
          experience.
        </p>

        <div class="links">
          <a href="https://babelgoods.netlify.app/" target="_blank">🌐 View Demo</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/Hassyunity/Babel" target="_blank">🔗 View Code</a>
          <a href="/comming-soon">✍️ Blog</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </body>
</html>
